---
description: Worktree frontend env must keep the Mapbox token
alwaysApply: true
---
When running `map-frontend/switch-env.sh` from a git worktree, copy
`VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN` from the main checkout `map-frontend/.env` if the
worktree `.env` does not already have one. Never rewrite `.env` with a
blank token. Vite only reads `.env` at startup; restart `npm run dev`
after filling the token. Do not print or commit the token.
